# skillrepo repository ignore policy
#
# This file can be used as a new skillrepo repository's `.gitignore`, or copied
# to a source root before creating a synchronization profile with the chosen
# snapshot tool.
#
# Goal: preserve config, skills, agents, scripts, references, assets, and
# other human-authored material while dropping obvious local/generated state.

# Version-control metadata from nested third-party repositories.
**/.git/
**/.git
**/.hg/
**/.svn/

# Dependency trees, interpreter caches, local model/data caches, and browser downloads.
# Keep manifests/lockfiles so dependencies can be reconstructed.
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.cache/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/local_cache/
**/local-cache/
**/.ms-playwright/

# Runtime browser profiles are local state and may contain cookies, history,
# saved login data, extension state, and other account/session material.
**/chrome-profile/

# Common application/browser caches and crash/runtime state.
**/Cache/
**/Code Cache/
**/GPUCache/
**/DawnCache/
**/GrShaderCache/
**/GraphiteDawnCache/
**/ShaderCache/
**/Crashpad/
**/BrowserMetrics/
**/blob_storage/
**/Service Worker/CacheStorage/
**/Service Worker/ScriptCache/
**/SingletonCookie
**/SingletonLock
**/SingletonSocket

# Browser/session stores that commonly contain account/session data.
**/Cookies
**/Cookies-journal
**/Login Data
**/Login Data-journal
**/Web Data
**/Web Data-journal
**/Local State

# Local databases / generated state. Migration analysis should use source files,
# not opaque runtime databases.
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm

# Obvious credential files. This does NOT protect secrets embedded inside other
# config/source files, so review the inventory before syncing.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.sample
**/credentials.json
**/credentials.*.json
**/client_secret*.json
**/token.json
**/token.*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/rclone.conf
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx

# Logs, temp files, editor/OS noise, and obvious backups.
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/*.bak
**/*.bak-*
**/*.local-bak-*/
**/*.broken-*
**/*.orig
**/*.rej
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/backup/
**/backups/
**/skill-bak/

# Keep the skillrepo inventory in the synchronized snapshot.
!.skillrepo-inventory/
!.skillrepo-inventory/**
